# Extracted from Dementia_Alzheimers_Patient_Assessment_Question_Bank.xlsx
# Original questions covering standard clinical domains -- does not reproduce
# any copyrighted instrument's exact wording (see the source workbook's own
# Licensing Notes sheet: MMSE, MoCA, GDS, Zarit, Katz/Lawton-Brody, FAST, CDR
# are all explicitly NOT reproduced here).
#
# The Onboarding & Intake phase was deliberately excluded from
# DEMENTIA_ASSESSMENTS (as a separate assessment TEMPLATE) — it duplicated
# what this app's mandatory Basic Patient Intake already covers for every
# patient regardless of program. Its 41 questions remain in QLIB_DEMENTIA
# below, still individually reusable via "Choose from library".
#
# "Date" question-bank fields map to the builder's real "date" field type.
#
# Options parsing correctly respects parentheses.
#
# An "Abuse, Neglect & Financial Exploitation Screening" section was added to
# Risk & Safety Assessment and the question library.
#
# Two Medical History fields in Diagnostic & Clinical Assessment were
# hand-improved from vague free-text to structured inputs:
# - primary_diagnosis_prompting_referral_for_nurse_care_services: text -> a
#   real dropdown with an Other + conditional free-text follow-up.
# - reason_s_for_and_approximate_date_s_of_recent_hospitalizations: one vague
#   textarea split into a real date picker, a reason dropdown (with its own
#   Other follow-up), and a narrower textarea reserved for any additional
#   hospitalizations beyond the single most recent one.

